(text "VDD and VDDH tied to 3.3 V, DCCH open: Raytac reference circuit 8.3 (REG0 off, supply below 3.6 V).\nModule pins 3-14 and 50-61 are low-frequency only (below 10 kHz): no SPI, I2C, UART or PWM there.\nY1: 32.768 kHz, 9 pF load, with 12 pF caps as in the Raytac reference.\nKeep copper out of the module antenna area (Raytac spec section 2.3)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 165.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "29888748-e6e6-536c-9831-1774977afbdf"))
